    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d296">

                <pb facs="0273" n="261" sameAs="frus:frus1942v04/pg261"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">891.24/285: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Iran</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Dreyfus</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tehran</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-11-12T16:00:00+03:25">November 12,
                            1942—4 p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received November 12—2:11 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>372. My number 364, November 9, 2 p.m.<anchor n="38" xml:id="d296-f1"/> Majlis
                    today passed law for employment of Millspaugh. Prime Minister urges that he come
                    forward as soon as possible since important financial legislation will be
                    suspended pending his arrival.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dreyfus</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
